7.3 Abstract

ComicCraft is an AI-powered web application designed to generate personalized comic stories and illustrations from user-provided prompts. The system uses Python and FastAPI for backend processing, HTML, CSS, and Jinja2 for the frontend, and Google's Gemini AI models for story generation. Stable Diffusion is used to create comic-style illustrations based on the generated scene descriptions.

The application allows users to specify a story prompt, character name, setting, tone, and art style. It generates a structured five-panel outline, detailed narration, character dialogues, and corresponding illustrations. The generated content is organized into a comic layout and can be exported as a PDF file.

ComicCraft aims to simplify the comic creation process by combining AI-based storytelling, image generation, and document export in a single web-based platform.

